      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ASTON MISSILE (7) was well supported last time and gave a sight after a fast early split but could manage only the minor money, finishing a 0.7 lengths second (25.42) over 450m at Warrnambool. The form out of last run is most impressive. Sure to be about the mark. SIN CITY NIGHTS (6) sizzled around 400m in 22.41 when winning a Mix 6/7 at this track last start. This tougher but looks a leading chance again. FREE POWER (2) racing well without winning, placing at his last four runs. Last start finished 2nd on August 4 over 400m at this track behind Our Bank beaten half a length (23.08) in a Mix 6/7. The form from his last run stacks up well. Expected to be in this for a long way. ASTON PROTON (1) should be thereabouts after filling a top-three at this track and distance most recently.",
